{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A bagel uses a grappling hook.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grappling Bagel</i> is a precision platformer where you must clear challenging levels by using the hole of a bagel as a grappling hook. Feel the pleasure of smooth swinging through tight momentum and responsive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An immersive bagel experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grappling Bagel</i> delivers a highly immersive sense of movement, with precise physical feedback that makes you feel like you are truly a bagel riding the rope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the sensation of becoming a bagel as you overcome challenging levels filled with springs, bumpers, gravity-reversing zones, and other physics-based elements.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706820?t=1758576725","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706820?t=1758576725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706820/2a1937d7c06408295d841bd4fce34e1c591a48b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758576725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706820/2a1937d7c06408295d841bd4fce34e1c591a48b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758576725","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3706840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A bagel uses a grappling hook.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_